		{
			"id":"b4759ee7293252df",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Contains a upgrade floppy disk that can be used on a terminal to permanently upgrade one of the draftable rooms in the game. (permanently consumed)\n\nYou can access the [[Terminals.canvas|Terminal]] here to spread gold over the rooms and also activate the payroll, while also accessing generic terminal functions.\n\nYou can also use other [[Terminals.canvas|Terminals]] functions, if you have access to them and also do generic terminal things.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-460,
			"y":-540,
			"width":560,
			"height":277
		},
		{"id":"f6d5882d44f2b2f9","type":"file","file":"99. attachments/BLUE_PRINCE_to7oDVvfin.png","x":1420,"y":60,"width":400,"height":344},
		{
			"id":"3c9168c360f9f8ad",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Safe Solution\n\nThere are three small statues of Isaac Gates on this room.\nThere is a paper saying March Count.\nThis can be translated to 0303, which is the password for the safe.\n\nThe translated message on [[026 - Study.canvas|026 - Study]] says\nIf we count small gates, eight dates, crack eight safes.\nGates is a reference to Isaac Gates.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1350,
			"y":-340,
			"width":540,
			"height":320
		}
	],
